  "description": "Based on our already versatile Great Divide road model, the Great Divide Disc is the perfect well-rounded road bike. With ample tire clearance, plenty of all-weather stopping power and the all-day comfort that only titanium can provide the Great Divide Disc is ready to tackle roads of any description.\n\nThe Great Divide Disc offers a clean, modern approach to a road disc frame with a flat mount rear caliper tucked neatly inside the rear triangle. Internal brake hose routing through the frame and fork keep external cables to a minimum, and thru-axles front and rear add stiffness to the frame and wheels even under heavy cornering loads.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBE SET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE THE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEAD SETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE NOW A STANDARD OFFERING ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nCUSTOM MODEL SPECIFIC FINISHING\n\nUDH STANDARD 3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAMLESS TITANIUM DROP-OUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED BRAKE BRIDGE WITH OPTIONAL HIDDEN FENDER MOUNT\n\nA FULL ARRAY OF NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS BESPOKE HARDWARE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS SEAT POST COLLAR",
